# NOTE: DDR4 DBI (Data Bus Inversion) pins removed when EMIF dropped to
# DDR4-1600 @ 800 MHz for ES silicon (A5ED065BB32AE6SR0). The ES variant
# emif_io96b_hps.ip does not export mem_dbi_n. Pin locations PIN_B119, AC90,
# V87, H87, B97 are now unbonded and free for future use. See
# doc/potential_issues.md ISSUE-011.

